WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:06.200
Every second of every day, thousands of visuals compete for your attention.

2
00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:12.567
Your brain decides in less than half a second whether something is worth a look.

3
00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:17.300
Graphic designers don't just make things look nice.

4
00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:21.267
They control where your eye travels.

5
00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:25.867
Contrast tells your brain what matters most.

6
00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:30.933
Hierarchy guides you from the headline down to the detail.

7
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:36.867
White space is not emptiness — it makes everything around it stand out.

8
00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:41.800
Color triggers emotion before you read a single word.

9
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.667
Typography communicates personality before you understand the message.

10
00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:52.800
Every great brand identity follows the same hidden visual rules.

11
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.333
Design is not decoration. It is direction.

12
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:03.433
Become a graphic designer at 0xverse Academy.

